<h1>{{childFirstName}}'s trial class has a new time</h1>
<p>Hi {{parentFirstName}}, we moved {{childFirstName}}'s trial class as you asked. {{mentorFirstName}} will be {{childFirstName}}'s mentor.</p>
<p class="when">{{when}}</p>
<p class="muted">Before: {{previousWhen}}</p>
<p class="actions"><a class="button" href="{{joinUrl}}">Join the class</a></p>
<p>The classroom opens {{opensBefore}} before the start. The class has a new personal link: use this one.</p>
<p><a href="{{manageUrl}}">View or change the booking</a>. You can reschedule until {{rescheduleCutoff}} before the class.</p>
<p class="muted">We attached the new calendar invite and a cancellation for the old time. Booking reference {{reference}}.</p>
